<title>USA: Wayne Twp., N.J., won by PNC Capital Markets.</title>
<headline>Wayne Twp., N.J., won by PNC Capital Markets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital Markets said it won $3.500 million of Wayne Twp., N.J., general improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.8227 percent.</p>
</text>
